Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["P-Adic Numbers", "GuideTitle", CellID->1636303661],
Cell["Represent and compute with p-adic numbers in a prime base. Construct exact periodic expansions of rational numbers, retain refinable expressions, or work with finite-precision approximations. Inspect digits, valuations, and periods, and visualize digit paths.", "GuideAbstract", CellID->680046945],
